# .gitignore for the PUBLIC braincell-mcp repo (clean-snapshot allowlist model).
# The public repo carries ONLY: code, images, guides, testing data,
# README.md, LICENSE, NOTICE, COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md.

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---- Secrets / env (never commit) ----
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.enc.yaml

# ---- SQLite / braincell runtime data ----
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*-wal
*-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.premerge.bak

# ---- Internal/maintainer files that must never land in the public repo ----
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
CHANGELOG.md
# CONTRIBUTING.md is KEPT (owner ruling 2026-07-23: it carries the CLA)
# QUICKSTART.md is KEPT (user-facing getting-started guide)
docs/PACKAGING-linux.md
BUGS.md
docs/STAGE_LOG.md
docs/*-2026-*.md
docs/isolation-and-federation.md
docs/embedder-selection-and-benchmarks.md
docs/claude-md-pruned-*.md
evals/
tests/benchmarks/*.md

# ---- OS / editor ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---- Explicit keeps (defensive re-includes against the globs above) ----
!docs/add-repo-runbook.md
!docs/images/*.png
